-- החלטת ועדת מעקב (12.3.2013): the follow-up committee, under §160 of the
-- base agreement of 25.12.2008, decides how §67 of that agreement — as the
-- completion agreement of 29.2.2012 replaced it (its §46) — applies to a
-- principal's pay in the school year תשע"ג alone, for one who goes on
-- leading the school he led in תשע"ב: a change of level that comes from
-- the nurture index alone, or with no parameter changed by 15%, changes
-- nothing; any other fall is cut to 75% of the fall the base agreement
-- would make, through a "תוספת מורכבות נצברת תשע"ג" of 25% of it; a fall
-- or rise of more than one level counts as one; the January 2013
-- overpayment is taken back in four parts; from תשע"ד the base agreement
-- applies again unless another agreement is reached; the same for the
-- principal of an attached junior high; and the decision exhausts the
-- parties' claims.
--
-- It applies the base agreement, so it imports what it changes: §67 as the
-- completion agreement replaced it (`the accumulated complexity
-- supplement`, `the accumulated complexity supplement after a rise`), the
-- level value of §67(ג), the parameters of §66 and the committee of §160.
-- The principals' salary table is an input (amounts.inputs).

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT conventions
IMPORT parties
IMPORT `base-agreement-66`
IMPORT `base-agreement-67`
IMPORT `base-agreement-160`
IMPORT `2012-02-29_ofek-hadash_amendment_hascam-hashlama`

-- What the parties may not do under this decision.
DECLARE `decision of 12.3.2013 action` IS ONE OF `raise a further claim on a matter the decision of 12.3.2013 settles`

-- The posts the decision speaks to: a school's principal (§1) and, by §4,
-- the principal of an attached junior high, "ואך ורק" — no other post.
DECLARE `post under the decision of 12.3.2013` IS ONE OF
    `principal of a school`
    `principal of an attached junior high`
    `another post`

@desc A principal in the school year תשע"ג (opening 1.9.2012), as far as the decision of 12.3.2013 asks.
DECLARE `principal in 5773` HAS
    `post`                                         IS A `post under the decision of 12.3.2013`
    `leads in 5773 the school he led in 5772`      IS A BOOLEAN @desc in the same post, in the school (or attached junior high) he led in תשע"ב
    `level in 5772`                                IS A NUMBER @desc the school's complexity level in תשע"ב
    `level in 5773`                                IS A NUMBER @desc the school's complexity level the Ministry set for תשע"ג under §66
    `the change comes only from the nurture index` IS A BOOLEAN @desc the change of level is the result of a change in the nurture index of §66(ב)(3) alone
    `the change in each parameter of (ב)`          IS A LIST OF NUMBER @desc the share by which the school's pupils, standard classes and special classes each changed against תשע"ב, up or down, as a positive number
    `combined salary by level`                     IS A LIST OF NUMBER @desc the principals' table for his grade and seniority, level 1 first; an input (amounts.inputs)
    `level values so far`                          IS A LIST OF NUMBER @desc the level value (§67(ג)) of each school year he led the school, to תשע"ב, as the completion agreement's §46 banks them
    `accumulated complexity supplement in 5772`    IS A NUMBER @desc the accumulated complexity supplement (§67 as replaced) he had in תשע"ב, if any

-- The principals' table, by level.
GIVEN level IS A NUMBER, p IS A `principal in 5773`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the combined salary at level` level `for` p IS
    at (p's `combined salary by level`) (level MINUS 1)

-- §67(ג) ¶2's level value: the combined salary less a level-1 principal's
-- of the same grade.
GIVEN level IS A NUMBER, p IS A `principal in 5773`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the level value at` level `for` p IS
    `the complexity supplement` (`the combined salary at level` level `for` p) (`the combined salary at level` 1 `for` p)

§ `החלטת ועדת המעקב — שכר מנהלים בשינוי רמת המורכבות — 12.3.2013`

-- akn:preamble The decision's frame: a label row with no text of its own.
-- akn:preamble/p1 A fax header; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p2 The registration stamp: registered as a collective agreement on 21.07.2013, number 97/2013; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p3 The title, with the handwritten date; no rule.

-- The opening: the follow-up committee decides under §160 of the base
-- agreement on applying §67 (as replaced by §46 of the completion
-- agreement) in תשע"ג. §160(ב)–(ג): the supreme committee is the wages
-- commissioner, the Ministry's director-general and the union's
-- secretary-general, and decides unanimously. The sign-off carries two of
-- the three (F-ofek-hadash-vaadat-maakav-2013-03-12-a); the reading
-- adopted: the decision binds as the committee's, the State and the union
-- having signed it and the registrar having registered it.
@ref akn:preamble/p4 akn:conclusions/t1
`the signatories of the decision of 12.3.2013` MEANS
    LIST `the wages commissioner at the Treasury`, `the teachers' union`

`the decision of 12.3.2013 lacks a §160 member's signature` MEANS
    NOT all (GIVEN m YIELD elem m `the signatories of the decision of 12.3.2013`) `the supreme committee's members`

#ASSERT `the decision of 12.3.2013 lacks a §160 member's signature`

§§ `1 שכרו של מנהל הממשיך לכהן באותו בית ספר בשנת הלימודים תשע"ג`

-- The opening: notwithstanding §67, for תשע"ג alone, for a principal who
-- goes on leading in תשע"ג the school he led in תשע"ב (and, by §4, the
-- principal of an attached junior high; §2 says the same from the other
-- side).
@ref akn:art_1
GIVEN p IS A `principal in 5773`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the decision of 12.3.2013 applies to` p IF
        p's `leads in 5773 the school he led in 5772`
    AND NOT p's `post` EQUALS `another post`

GIVEN p IS A `principal in 5773`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the level fell in 5773` p IF
    p's `level in 5773` LESS THAN p's `level in 5772`

GIVEN p IS A `principal in 5773`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the level rose in 5773` p IF
    p's `level in 5773` GREATER THAN p's `level in 5772`

-- "שכר" for (ג)–(ה): the combined salary and the accumulated complexity
-- supplement, so far as he has one (¶2 of (ג), below).
GIVEN p IS A `principal in 5773`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the 5772 salary of` p IS
    `the combined salary at level` (p's `level in 5772`) `for` p PLUS p's `accumulated complexity supplement in 5772`

-- The salary in תשע"ג at a level "but for this decision": §67 as the
-- completion agreement replaced it. On a fall, the new level's combined
-- salary and the accumulated complexity supplement §46(ג) computes from
-- the level values banked; on a rise, the new level's combined salary and
-- what is left of the supplement after the rise (§46(ג)(5)).
GIVEN level IS A NUMBER, p IS A `principal in 5773`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the 5773 salary at level` level `but for the decision, for` p IS
    BRANCH
        IF level LESS THAN p's `level in 5772`
        THEN `the combined salary at level` level `for` p
             PLUS `the accumulated complexity supplement` (p's `level values so far`) (`the level value at` level `for` p)
        IF level GREATER THAN p's `level in 5772`
        THEN `the combined salary at level` level `for` p
             PLUS `the accumulated complexity supplement after a rise`
                      (p's `accumulated complexity supplement in 5772`)
                      (`the combined salary at level` level `for` p MINUS `the combined salary at level` (p's `level in 5772`) `for` p)
        OTHERWISE `the 5772 salary of` p

-- (א): a change of level, up or down, that comes from a change in the
-- nurture index (§66(ב)(3)) alone changes nothing in תשע"ג.
@ref akn:art_1__para_a
GIVEN p IS A `principal in 5773`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `(א) of the decision of 12.3.2013 applies to` p IF
        (`the level fell in 5773` p OR `the level rose in 5773` p)
    AND p's `the change comes only from the nurture index`

-- (ב)(1)–(3) and ¶2: a change of level with no change of at least 15%
-- against the year before in any one of the pupils, the standard classes
-- and the special classes changes nothing in תשע"ג. "לפחות 15%" holds 15%:
-- a change of exactly 15% is a change.
@ref akn:art_1__para_b akn:art_1__para_b__subpara_1 akn:art_1__para_b__subpara_2 akn:art_1__para_b__subpara_3 akn:art_1__para_b/p2
`the share of a change in a parameter that counts` MEANS 15%

`the parameters of (ב)` MEANS
    LIST `pupils in the school`, `standard classes in the school`, `special classes in an ordinary school`

GIVEN p IS A `principal in 5773`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `(ב) of the decision of 12.3.2013 applies to` p IF
        (`the level fell in 5773` p OR `the level rose in 5773` p)
    AND all (GIVEN c YIELD c LESS THAN `the share of a change in a parameter that counts`) (p's `the change in each parameter of (ב)`)

-- The three parameters are three of the five §66(ב) weighs.
#ASSERT all (GIVEN x YIELD elem x (`the parameters weighed for` `a primary or junior high school`)) `the parameters of (ב)`

GIVEN p IS A `principal in 5773`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the change of level is frozen in 5773` p IF
    `(א) of the decision of 12.3.2013 applies to` p OR `(ב) of the decision of 12.3.2013 applies to` p

-- (ג): any other fall: in תשע"ג his salary is reduced by 75% of the sum
-- the base agreement (as the completion agreement amended it) would have
-- reduced it by but for this decision. ¶2: "שכר", for (ג) alone, is the
-- combined salary and the accumulated complexity supplement.
@ref akn:art_1__para_c akn:art_1__para_c/p2
`the share of the fall (ג) keeps` MEANS 75%

GIVEN p IS A `principal in 5773`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `(ג) of the decision of 12.3.2013 applies to` p IF
    `the level fell in 5773` p AND NOT `the change of level is frozen in 5773` p

GIVEN p IS A `principal in 5773`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the salary (ג) gives` p IS
    `the 5772 salary of` p
    MINUS `the share of the fall (ג) keeps`
          TIMES (`the 5772 salary of` p MINUS `the 5773 salary at level` (p's `level in 5773`) `but for the decision, for` p)

-- (ה)(1): where the level fell by more than one, for his pay it is taken to
-- have fallen by one; (ו): where it rose by more than one, by one. (ו)
-- names only (ב) as the case it leaves alone, and (ז) only (ב) and (ו), so
-- a rise from the nurture index alone, which (א) freezes, is also in (ו)
-- or (ז) as printed (F-ofek-hadash-vaadat-maakav-2013-03-12-b). The reading
-- adopted (convention precedence.specific): (א), which names the cause,
-- governs, as (ג) and (ה) leave it alone in so many words.
@ref akn:art_1__para_e akn:art_1__para_e__subpara_1 akn:art_1__para_f
GIVEN p IS A `principal in 5773`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `(ה) of the decision of 12.3.2013 applies to` p IF
        `(ג) of the decision of 12.3.2013 applies to` p
    AND p's `level in 5772` MINUS p's `level in 5773` GREATER THAN 1

GIVEN p IS A `principal in 5773`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `(ו) of the decision of 12.3.2013, as printed, applies to` p IF
        `the level rose in 5773` p
    AND NOT `(ב) of the decision of 12.3.2013 applies to` p
    AND p's `level in 5773` MINUS p's `level in 5772` GREATER THAN 1

GIVEN p IS A `principal in 5773`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `(ו) of the decision of 12.3.2013 applies to` p IF
        `(ו) of the decision of 12.3.2013, as printed, applies to` p
    AND NOT `(א) of the decision of 12.3.2013 applies to` p

GIVEN p IS A `principal in 5773`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the level counted for the 5773 pay of` p IS
    BRANCH
        IF `(ה) of the decision of 12.3.2013 applies to` p THEN p's `level in 5772` MINUS 1
        IF `(ו) of the decision of 12.3.2013 applies to` p THEN p's `level in 5772` PLUS 1
        OTHERWISE p's `level in 5773`

GIVEN p IS A `principal in 5773`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the 5773 salary at the counted level, but for the rest of the decision, for` p IS
    `the 5773 salary at level` (`the level counted for the 5773 pay of` p) `but for the decision, for` p

-- (ד), and (ה)(2) where the level fell by more than one: the "תוספת
-- מורכבות נצברת תשע"ג", for תשע"ג alone and beside any accumulated
-- complexity supplement he has, is 25% of the gap between the salary he had
-- in תשע"ב and the one he would have had in תשע"ג but for the decision
-- (after (ה)(1), where it applies).
@ref akn:art_1__para_d akn:art_1__para_e__subpara_2
`the share of the gap the 5773 supplement pays` MEANS 25%

GIVEN p IS A `principal in 5773`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the 5773 accumulated complexity supplement of` p IS
    IF `the decision of 12.3.2013 applies to` p AND `(ג) of the decision of 12.3.2013 applies to` p
    THEN `the share of the gap the 5773 supplement pays`
         TIMES (`the 5772 salary of` p MINUS `the 5773 salary at the counted level, but for the rest of the decision, for` p)
    ELSE 0

-- (ז): any other rise — not under (ב) or (ו), nor, by the reading above,
-- under (א) — is paid under the base agreement (as the completion
-- agreement amended it) unchanged.
@ref akn:art_1__para_g
GIVEN p IS A `principal in 5773`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `(ז) of the decision of 12.3.2013, as printed, applies to` p IF
        `the level rose in 5773` p
    AND NOT `(ב) of the decision of 12.3.2013 applies to` p
    AND NOT `(ו) of the decision of 12.3.2013, as printed, applies to` p

-- His salary in תשע"ג under the decision.
GIVEN p IS A `principal in 5773`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the 5773 salary under the decision of 12.3.2013` p IS
    BRANCH
        IF NOT `the decision of 12.3.2013 applies to` p
        THEN `the 5773 salary at level` (p's `level in 5773`) `but for the decision, for` p
        IF `the change of level is frozen in 5773` p
        THEN `the 5772 salary of` p
        OTHERWISE `the 5773 salary at the counted level, but for the rest of the decision, for` p
                  PLUS `the 5773 accumulated complexity supplement of` p

-- akn:art_1__para_g/p2 A fax header; no rule.

-- (ח): a principal paid for January 2013 more than this section gives,
-- because the levels for תשע"ג were set late, has the January overpayment
-- taken off in four equal parts from the salaries of February to May 2013;
-- what was overpaid for September to December 2012 is not taken off.
@ref akn:art_1__para_h
GIVEN `salary month` IS A DATE, `overpaid for January 2013` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the January 2013 overpayment taken off the salary of` `salary month` `overpaid for January 2013` IS
    IF     `salary month` `is on or after` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 2 2013)
       AND `salary month` `is on or before` (DATE_FROM_DMY 31 5 2013)
    THEN `overpaid for January 2013` DIVIDED BY 4
    ELSE 0

`overpayments for September to December 2012 are taken off` MEANS FALSE

#ASSERT sum (map (GIVEN m YIELD `the January 2013 overpayment taken off the salary of` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 m 2013) 1000) (range 1 12)) EQUALS 1000
#ASSERT `the January 2013 overpayment taken off the salary of` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 6 2013) 1000 EQUALS 0

-- Worked cases, on a placeholder table of 10,000 at level 1 and 1,000 more
-- a level, and a principal who led the school four years at level 3.
GIVEN `level in 5773` IS A NUMBER, `only the nurture index` IS A BOOLEAN, `largest parameter change` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `principal in 5773`
DECIDE `a principal at level 3 since 5769, at level` `level in 5773` `in 5773` `only the nurture index` `largest parameter change` IS
    `principal in 5773` WITH
        `post`                                         IS `principal of a school`
        `leads in 5773 the school he led in 5772`      IS TRUE
        `level in 5772`                                IS 3
        `level in 5773`                                IS `level in 5773`
        `the change comes only from the nurture index` IS `only the nurture index`
        `the change in each parameter of (ב)`          IS LIST `largest parameter change`, 0, 0
        `combined salary by level`                     IS LIST 10000, 11000, 12000, 13000
        `level values so far`                          IS LIST 2000, 2000, 2000, 2000
        `accumulated complexity supplement in 5772`    IS 0

-- A fall from 3 to 2 with the pupils down 20%: but for the decision, 11,000
-- and N = 4 × 10% × 2,000 + 60% × 1,000 − 1,000 = 400, so 11,400 against
-- 12,000; the decision keeps 75% of the fall of 600: 11,550.
#ASSERT `the 5773 salary at level` 2 `but for the decision, for` (`a principal at level 3 since 5769, at level` 2 `in 5773` FALSE (20%)) EQUALS 11400
#ASSERT `the 5773 salary under the decision of 12.3.2013` (`a principal at level 3 since 5769, at level` 2 `in 5773` FALSE (20%)) EQUALS 11550
-- (ג) and (ד) say one thing: cut by 75% of the fall, or paid the lower
-- salary and 25% of the gap.
`(ג) and (ד) give one salary for a fall from 3 to 2` MEANS
    `the salary (ג) gives` (`a principal at level 3 since 5769, at level` 2 `in 5773` FALSE (20%))
        EQUALS `the 5773 salary under the decision of 12.3.2013` (`a principal at level 3 since 5769, at level` 2 `in 5773` FALSE (20%))
#ASSERT `(ג) and (ד) give one salary for a fall from 3 to 2`
-- The same fall with every parameter changed by less than 15%: frozen.
#ASSERT `the 5773 salary under the decision of 12.3.2013` (`a principal at level 3 since 5769, at level` 2 `in 5773` FALSE (14%)) EQUALS 12000
-- A fall from 3 to 1: counted as a fall to 2, so 11,550 again.
#ASSERT `the 5773 salary under the decision of 12.3.2013` (`a principal at level 3 since 5769, at level` 1 `in 5773` FALSE (20%)) EQUALS 11550
-- A rise from 3 to 4 from the nurture index alone: (א) freezes it at 12,000.
#ASSERT `the 5773 salary under the decision of 12.3.2013` (`a principal at level 3 since 5769, at level` 4 `in 5773` TRUE (20%)) EQUALS 12000

-- F-ofek-hadash-vaadat-maakav-2013-03-12-b's evidence: that rise is in (א)
-- and, as printed, in (ז) as well — which pays it at 13,000.
`a rise from the nurture index alone is in (א) and in (ז)` MEANS
        `(א) of the decision of 12.3.2013 applies to` (`a principal at level 3 since 5769, at level` 4 `in 5773` TRUE (20%))
    AND `(ז) of the decision of 12.3.2013, as printed, applies to` (`a principal at level 3 since 5769, at level` 4 `in 5773` TRUE (20%))
#ASSERT `a rise from the nurture index alone is in (א) and in (ז)`

§§ `2 מנהל שעבר בית ספר או שהחל לכהן בתשע"ג`

-- §1 does not reach a principal who moved in תשע"ג to lead another school
-- at another level, or who began as a principal in תשע"ג: neither leads the
-- school he led in תשע"ב, which is what §1 asks.
@ref akn:art_2
`a principal who moved school in 5773` MEANS
    `principal in 5773` WITH
        `post`                                         IS `principal of a school`
        `leads in 5773 the school he led in 5772`      IS FALSE
        `level in 5772`                                IS 3
        `level in 5773`                                IS 2
        `the change comes only from the nurture index` IS FALSE
        `the change in each parameter of (ב)`          IS LIST 0, 0, 0
        `combined salary by level`                     IS LIST 10000, 11000, 12000, 13000
        `level values so far`                          IS LIST 2000
        `accumulated complexity supplement in 5772`    IS 0

#ASSERT NOT `the decision of 12.3.2013 applies to` `a principal who moved school in 5773`

§§ `3 השנים שמתשע"ד ואילך`

-- Unless another agreement is reached for תשע"ד on, from תשע"ד the base
-- agreement applies again as it stood on the eve of this decision: (א) the
-- "תוספת מורכבות נצברת תשע"ג" is paid no more; (ב) the principals' pay
-- from תשע"ד is computed as if the decision had never applied in תשע"ג, so
-- the level value banked for תשע"ג is the one of his school's real level.
-- The agreement of 17.9.2013 is such another agreement (its §14(ו)).
@ref akn:art_3 akn:art_3__para_a akn:art_3__para_b
GIVEN y IS A NUMBER, `another agreement governs that year` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the base agreement as it stood before 12.3.2013 governs the principal's pay in the school year opening in` y `another agreement governs that year` IF
    y AT LEAST 2013 AND NOT `another agreement governs that year`

GIVEN y IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the 5773 accumulated complexity supplement is paid in the school year opening in` y IF
    y EQUALS 2012

GIVEN p IS A `principal in 5773`
GIVETH A LIST OF NUMBER
DECIDE `the level values banked to 5773, for the pay from 5774, of` p IS
    append (p's `level values so far`) (LIST (`the level value at` (p's `level in 5773`) `for` p))

#ASSERT NOT `the 5773 accumulated complexity supplement is paid in the school year opening in` 2013
#ASSERT `the base agreement as it stood before 12.3.2013 governs the principal's pay in the school year opening in` 2013 FALSE
#ASSERT NOT `the base agreement as it stood before 12.3.2013 governs the principal's pay in the school year opening in` 2013 TRUE
#ASSERT `the level values banked to 5773, for the pay from 5774, of` (`a principal at level 3 since 5769, at level` 2 `in 5773` FALSE (20%)) EQUALS LIST 2000, 2000, 2000, 2000, 1000

§§ `4 מנהל חטיבת ביניים צמודה`

-- §§1–3 apply also, and only, to the principal of an attached junior high
-- who goes on leading in תשע"ג the one he led in תשע"ב: that post is in
-- `the decision of 12.3.2013 applies to`, and every other is out.
@ref akn:art_4
GIVEN post IS A `post under the decision of 12.3.2013`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the decision of 12.3.2013 reaches the post` post IF
    NOT post EQUALS `another post`

#ASSERT `the decision of 12.3.2013 reaches the post` `principal of an attached junior high`
#ASSERT NOT `the decision of 12.3.2013 reaches the post` `another post`

§§ `5 מיצוי תביעות`

-- The decision exhausts every claim of the parties on what it settles,
-- the time before its signing included.
@ref akn:art_5
`no further claims under the decision of 12.3.2013` MEANS
    (PARTY `the State`
     SHANT `raise a further claim on a matter the decision of 12.3.2013 settles`)
    RAND
    (PARTY `the teachers' union`
     SHANT `raise a further claim on a matter the decision of 12.3.2013 settles`)

-- akn:conclusions The sign-off: a label row with no text of its own.
-- akn:conclusions/p1 The signatures; no rule.
-- akn:conclusions/p2 The Treasury's filing mark; no rule.
